WEBVTT

01:28.985 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:42.425 --> 01:44.345
Cangcang, don't worry.

01:44.425 --> 01:46.105
His Majesty's a blessed man.

01:47.625 --> 01:49.025
How can I not worry?

01:49.545 --> 01:50.945
His condition's getting worse
by the minute.

01:51.025 --> 01:51.865
Why isn't Physician Li here yet?

01:51.945 --> 01:53.185
I received a report

01:53.265 --> 01:55.305
that Li Hongqing is escorting Physician Li
on his way over.

01:55.385 --> 01:56.585
He should be here any minute.

01:58.745 --> 01:59.585
Your Highness.

01:59.665 --> 02:02.545
POST STATION

02:05.705 --> 02:06.945
What brings you here, Your Highness?

02:07.025 --> 02:08.505
A matter of life and death.

02:08.584 --> 02:09.785
Please mind your words.

02:13.225 --> 02:15.465
Looks like he really is on his last legs.

02:15.545 --> 02:18.025
Then I all the more
have to see him one last time.

02:20.945 --> 02:22.185
-Hey…
-Physician Li is here.

02:25.705 --> 02:26.785
You're here.

02:27.305 --> 02:28.985
Quite the crowd you've got here.

02:29.065 --> 02:29.945
Where's that brat?

02:30.025 --> 02:31.305
This way, please.

02:43.185 --> 02:44.545
Cangcang, calm down.

02:44.625 --> 02:46.745
Physician Li already said
he can still be saved.

02:50.025 --> 02:52.025
But he's been treating him all day

02:52.105 --> 02:53.425
and there's still no change.

03:00.065 --> 03:01.385
Your brother is blessed by heaven.

03:01.465 --> 03:02.305
Don't work yourself up.

03:10.665 --> 03:12.945
No. I'll go check on him.

03:16.145 --> 03:17.065
Physician Li!

03:17.585 --> 03:18.545
How is he?

03:19.585 --> 03:20.745
Your Majesty,

03:20.825 --> 03:22.305
as long as His Majesty pulls through

03:22.385 --> 03:24.265
and wakes up, he'll be out of danger!

03:24.785 --> 03:25.625
He'll be fine?

04:07.225 --> 04:10.065
Cangcang,
what's going on between you and Xiao Huan?

04:15.545 --> 04:16.624
What's between us

04:18.745 --> 04:20.545
isn't something you can explain
in a few words.

04:23.225 --> 04:25.585
If he really gets better,

04:25.665 --> 04:27.585
will you go back to the palace with him?

04:32.705 --> 04:33.825
I don't know.

04:37.745 --> 04:40.505
Given Master's death, Luo's tragedy,

04:41.145 --> 04:43.185
and everything between my father and him…

04:51.945 --> 04:53.145
Let's not talk about this.

05:13.545 --> 05:14.905
Why isn't he waking up yet?

05:26.225 --> 05:27.385
You're awake?

05:29.585 --> 05:30.665
Where's Cangcang?

05:32.705 --> 05:34.665
She's outside catching up with Zhong Lin.

05:39.505 --> 05:40.625
You saved me at last.

05:42.185 --> 05:44.945
That stubborn Physician Li forced me

05:45.465 --> 05:47.345
to hand over the Frost Blossom.

05:47.425 --> 05:48.505
I honestly wasn't planning to save you.

05:50.025 --> 05:53.905
But Her Majesty
sent her best friend, Zhong Lin,

05:53.985 --> 05:55.865
to cling to me and beg nonstop.

05:56.825 --> 05:58.505
Only then did I decide to spare your life.

05:58.585 --> 06:00.025
Once you're better,

06:00.105 --> 06:01.265
I'll come settle the score with you.

06:02.785 --> 06:05.265
So you're saying
I don't need to thank you,

06:06.065 --> 06:10.465
just my empress,
Zhong Lin and Physician Li?

06:10.545 --> 06:11.545
Hey…

06:11.625 --> 06:13.505
How can you be so heartless?

06:18.385 --> 06:19.465
So,

06:19.545 --> 06:22.465
do you like the present I gave you?

06:25.425 --> 06:26.425
This pouch is for you.

06:26.505 --> 06:27.905
When the time is right,

06:28.425 --> 06:29.785
you can open it.

06:33.145 --> 06:34.345
I don't like it.

06:36.585 --> 06:38.065
When I needed it, it wasn't there.

06:38.585 --> 06:40.705
If you send it too late,
it doesn't mean anything.

06:41.985 --> 06:43.465
It's just like a true heart:

06:44.105 --> 06:45.425
if it gets no answer,

06:45.985 --> 06:47.385
then there's no need to answer ever again.

06:49.145 --> 06:50.185
Is that so?

06:50.865 --> 06:52.945
Then give the Divination Chart back to me.

06:56.785 --> 06:57.625
Hey…

06:57.705 --> 06:59.785
Trying to take back a gift
you've already given?

07:00.385 --> 07:02.625
Then spit out the Frost Blossom
and give that back to me too.

07:02.705 --> 07:06.865
To find that lousy leaf
that could save your life,

07:06.945 --> 07:08.345
I almost lost mine.

07:11.745 --> 07:13.065
What are you laughing at?

07:14.225 --> 07:15.145
Name it.

07:15.665 --> 07:18.425
What else do you want
besides the Divination Chart?

07:22.385 --> 07:23.945
Let me think about it.

07:39.825 --> 07:42.385
The poison you took that day
was incurable.

07:43.065 --> 07:43.905
His Majesty

07:44.545 --> 07:46.225
gave you his Frost Reed.

07:46.305 --> 07:49.585
He gave you the only Frost Reed
that could have saved his life!

07:51.545 --> 07:54.025
-Cangcang…
-I'm here. I'm right here.

07:54.945 --> 07:56.305
Don't leave me…

07:58.985 --> 08:00.025
Cangcang,

08:00.105 --> 08:01.745
I really like you.

08:02.265 --> 08:04.185
Marry me, will you?

08:16.105 --> 08:17.105
Cangcang,

08:17.625 --> 08:18.705
Father,

08:19.545 --> 08:20.945
My death means nothing!

09:14.865 --> 09:15.945
Has the Empress not come yet?

09:16.545 --> 09:17.625
Her Majesty should already be resting.

09:18.625 --> 09:20.025
You should rest early too.

09:21.865 --> 09:22.945
I'll go check on her.

09:23.705 --> 09:24.585
Your Majesty.

09:34.025 --> 09:35.105
Your Majesty,

09:35.185 --> 09:39.385
do you think my golden reputation
hasn't been smashed hard enough by you?

09:41.065 --> 09:43.785
Physician Li, I'm already fine.

09:43.865 --> 09:44.825
Fine, my foot!

09:44.905 --> 09:47.305
You just haven't managed to die yet!
Now hurry back!

10:51.825 --> 10:53.305
What a beautiful hairpin!

10:53.385 --> 10:54.705
When the pear blossoms are in full bloom,

10:54.785 --> 10:56.305
I'll take you to my pear garden.

10:58.385 --> 11:00.225
This splendid Capital

11:01.065 --> 11:03.745
is riddled with scheming and deceit.

11:03.825 --> 11:05.305
I've lost

11:08.145 --> 11:09.305
and I'm tired.

11:15.345 --> 11:16.185
Cangcang,

11:17.345 --> 11:18.425
what are you thinking about?

11:18.945 --> 11:19.945
Nothing.

11:22.745 --> 11:24.585
What is it that's got you so happy?

11:25.825 --> 11:26.865
Nothing.

11:27.385 --> 11:30.065
It's just that His Majesty said
life at the border is harsh,

11:30.145 --> 11:31.465
so he'll give me a month off every year

11:31.545 --> 11:33.505
to come back and visit you and Father.

11:34.345 --> 11:35.305
Really?

11:35.865 --> 11:37.265
He even wrote the decree himself.

11:37.345 --> 11:40.105
He's also sending officials
over agriculture and works

11:40.185 --> 11:41.465
to open up trade routes for Jiangzhou.

11:41.545 --> 11:43.825
Later, I'll meet with Kumor to discuss

11:43.905 --> 11:46.065
how to resettle the people of Xijiang.

11:47.185 --> 11:48.105
That's wonderful.

11:51.185 --> 11:52.585
Cangcang,

11:52.665 --> 11:55.825
Father always told me
emperors are the most heartless,

11:55.905 --> 11:56.985
that a ruler's heart is unreadable.

11:57.065 --> 11:59.585
He wanted me to train hard
and become a strong warlord.

11:59.665 --> 12:01.185
But I think

12:01.705 --> 12:03.745
His Majesty isn't as heartless
as Father said.

12:04.345 --> 12:05.505
He's an emperor,

12:06.025 --> 12:07.185
but he has a kind heart.

12:09.185 --> 12:10.185
Yes,

12:11.465 --> 12:12.345
he's a good emperor.

12:13.545 --> 12:15.345
Most importantly, he treats you well.

12:16.345 --> 12:18.105
He's willing
to ride into the enemy camp for you,

12:18.185 --> 12:19.025
risking his life.

12:19.625 --> 12:20.545
You can't ask for more than that.

12:24.945 --> 12:25.785
Cangcang,

12:25.865 --> 12:27.825
hurry up
and give birth to a little prince.

12:27.905 --> 12:29.505
I'm dying to be an uncle.

12:31.945 --> 12:32.865
You brat,

12:33.385 --> 12:35.665
what do you think about all day?

12:37.985 --> 12:38.825
Cangcang,

12:39.545 --> 12:42.665
I feel like
things between you and His Majesty

12:43.185 --> 12:44.065
are a little off.

12:44.945 --> 12:46.465
Back when he was seriously ill,

12:46.545 --> 12:48.225
you stayed by his side every moment.

12:48.745 --> 12:50.105
When he was in danger,

12:50.185 --> 12:51.785
you even risked your own life to save him.

12:52.425 --> 12:53.945
But now that he's awake,

12:54.465 --> 12:55.625
you won't go and see him.

12:58.745 --> 12:59.865
What's between us

13:03.345 --> 13:04.345
isn't something you'd understand!

13:07.145 --> 13:09.305
There's nothing a good drink can't fix.

13:10.345 --> 13:11.505
Cangcang,

13:11.585 --> 13:13.865
back when you insisted on
roaming the martial world,

13:13.945 --> 13:15.265
Father was dead set against it.

13:15.345 --> 13:16.545
Didn't you say

13:16.625 --> 13:19.665
all those martial world dreams
aren't worth a single cup of wine?

13:19.745 --> 13:22.585
I've never seen you
this weighed down before.

13:25.105 --> 13:26.105
Yeah.

13:27.665 --> 13:29.025
A sword and a jar of wine,

13:29.545 --> 13:31.305
that's the Cangcang I'm supposed to be.

13:40.025 --> 13:42.465
Cangcang, where are you going?

13:43.705 --> 13:45.825
His Majesty's better now.

13:46.385 --> 13:48.065
I've still got things to do,
so I have to leave first.

13:49.225 --> 13:50.225
You're not staying with His Majesty?

13:56.065 --> 13:59.145
POST STATION

14:18.025 --> 14:20.665
Your Majesty,
Her Majesty left early this morning.

14:23.025 --> 14:25.465
Summon Kumor and Ling Jueding
to discuss affairs.

14:25.545 --> 14:27.985
Your body
still can't take too much strain.

14:28.065 --> 14:29.185
It's fine.

14:29.745 --> 14:32.625
I need to get everything in Xijiang
and Jiangzhou properly arranged

14:32.705 --> 14:33.865
so we can set out as soon as possible.

14:34.545 --> 14:35.385
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:36.985 --> 14:39.225
Hongqing,
escort Physician Li back to the Capital.

14:40.265 --> 14:41.905
Shi Yan, return to Fenglai Pavilion.

14:45.305 --> 14:46.145
All right.

14:46.225 --> 14:47.385
General Ling,

14:47.465 --> 14:48.465
even though Jiangzhou is settled,

14:48.545 --> 14:51.105
there will be plenty of loose ends.

14:51.185 --> 14:52.745
I hope you won't relax your guard.

14:53.985 --> 14:55.065
I obey, Your Majesty.

14:55.145 --> 14:56.905
I will see to everything personally.

14:58.265 --> 14:59.105
General Ling,

14:59.625 --> 15:02.665
do you know where the Empress has gone?

15:05.265 --> 15:06.105
My sister didn't tell me.

15:06.745 --> 15:07.585
But…

15:07.665 --> 15:08.985
Your Majesty may head toward Yanxia Lake.

15:09.065 --> 15:11.425
She once said she wanted to see it.

15:12.785 --> 15:13.665
All right.

15:14.225 --> 15:15.505
Thank you, General Ling!

15:18.185 --> 15:19.665
Your Majesty!

15:20.225 --> 15:22.305
You've only just begun to recover.

15:22.385 --> 15:24.025
You can't push yourself like this!

15:24.105 --> 15:25.505
Physician Li,

15:25.585 --> 15:27.625
didn't I tell you I'm already fine?

15:28.265 --> 15:30.225
And I just took my medicine, didn't I?

15:31.705 --> 15:32.985
Your Majesty…

15:34.825 --> 15:35.985
Don't kneel.

16:01.665 --> 16:04.265
Madam, General Lu requests an audience.

16:09.945 --> 16:11.465
-Let him in.
-Yes, Madam.

16:19.305 --> 16:20.265
Preceptor Du.

16:20.785 --> 16:21.745
General Lu.

16:22.785 --> 16:23.625
How is His Majesty?

16:24.785 --> 16:26.185
His Majesty and Her Majesty

16:26.825 --> 16:27.705
will be able to return soon.

16:27.785 --> 16:28.905
How is His Majesty's health?

16:29.505 --> 16:31.185
His Majesty is in excellent health.

16:31.265 --> 16:33.105
It's just… it's just…

16:35.225 --> 16:36.425
Just what?

16:38.105 --> 16:40.785
His Majesty gave a verbal edict
for me to pass on to you.

16:43.105 --> 16:43.985
What edict?

16:45.945 --> 16:47.385
His Majesty said

16:47.985 --> 16:49.665
the Empress will soon return
to the palace,

16:51.465 --> 16:53.185
and that you…

16:55.705 --> 16:57.025
that you are

16:57.665 --> 17:00.465
to remember what he told you
back in Jiangzhou.

17:05.265 --> 17:06.224
In this world,

17:06.745 --> 17:08.464
there is more than one person

17:08.985 --> 17:10.464
who can heal my body.

17:11.585 --> 17:13.025
But as for my empress,

17:13.545 --> 17:14.985
there's only Cangcang.

17:23.065 --> 17:24.785
I obey, Your Majesty.

17:27.105 --> 17:27.985
Madam!

17:32.385 --> 17:34.225
Madam, what happened to you?

17:42.225 --> 17:43.945
I followed His Majesty's will

17:44.585 --> 17:46.625
and reflected in Nanrong Palace.

17:48.505 --> 17:50.385
But you can't hurt yourself.

17:51.065 --> 17:52.825
So what if I hurt myself?

17:54.105 --> 17:55.745
No one cares anyway.

17:56.505 --> 17:57.345
I…

18:02.905 --> 18:03.785
Coward.

18:04.985 --> 18:06.705
-Madam…
-You like someone but don't dare admit it.

18:06.785 --> 18:08.905
If that doesn't make you a coward,
what does?

18:12.265 --> 18:13.625
Madam,

18:13.705 --> 18:16.785
do you still remember
your mother's last words?

18:25.985 --> 18:27.305
Think this through.

18:28.225 --> 18:30.145
If you stay by my side today,

18:30.665 --> 18:32.585
you belong to me from now on,

18:35.385 --> 18:38.065
your life and death at my command.

18:41.945 --> 18:42.985
If you want my heart,

18:44.625 --> 18:46.265
I will give it to you!

19:21.105 --> 19:22.465
Come catch me!

19:24.345 --> 19:25.505
Catch me!

19:27.425 --> 19:28.705
You can't catch me!

19:33.065 --> 19:34.465
I never imagined

19:35.105 --> 19:37.105
that after all these years,

19:37.905 --> 19:40.705
there'd be so many shops here.

19:49.745 --> 19:50.665
Sir,

19:51.185 --> 19:54.505
-one plate of fennel dumplings.
-Got it!

19:55.025 --> 19:57.905
Today is my foster son's birthday.

19:57.985 --> 19:58.825
And also,

19:59.385 --> 20:01.065
-bring a small jar of wine too.
-All right!

20:18.385 --> 20:19.665
Luo!

20:22.705 --> 20:23.745
Cangcang!

20:25.105 --> 20:26.945
I can't protect you anymore!

20:28.065 --> 20:29.385
Live well.

20:31.545 --> 20:33.265
You must live on!

20:44.505 --> 20:45.345
Cangcang,

20:46.585 --> 20:47.545
we'll meet again someday.

20:58.385 --> 20:59.505
Good child,

20:59.585 --> 21:02.865
I'll be waiting for good news from you.

21:07.945 --> 21:10.585
I will not fail your expectations!

21:28.865 --> 21:29.945
Long live Lingbi!

21:30.625 --> 21:31.985
All hail the Protector!

21:36.465 --> 21:38.025
Long live Lingbi!

21:38.105 --> 21:39.145
All hail the Protector!

21:40.585 --> 21:41.625
Xianxue,

21:43.145 --> 21:44.665
you've done very well.

21:46.025 --> 21:48.025
You make me proud.

21:56.385 --> 21:57.585
Thank you for backing me, Father.

21:58.265 --> 22:00.385
But what brings you here this time?

22:05.985 --> 22:07.865
Has something happened in Jiangzhou?

22:08.385 --> 22:10.385
The Jiangzhou crisis is over.

22:10.465 --> 22:13.625
Jueding got out of it in one piece.

22:13.705 --> 22:14.985
But Xiao Huan

22:16.825 --> 22:18.905
sacrificed the status verification system

22:19.705 --> 22:21.345
to make Kumor agree to withdraw.

22:25.585 --> 22:26.665
But Father,

22:27.225 --> 22:30.185
wasn't the system your idea?

22:34.065 --> 22:37.865
Xiao Huan wants Xiao Qianqing
to act as Regent

22:37.945 --> 22:40.825
mainly to counter me
and the Empress Dowager,

22:40.905 --> 22:42.985
so he can reap all the gains,

22:43.785 --> 22:46.225
and push his
talent recommendation system through.

22:49.865 --> 22:52.545
New emperor, new court.

22:53.105 --> 22:56.585
He means to stand against me completely.

22:57.705 --> 22:58.865
And that's not all.

22:59.385 --> 23:01.505
Xiao Qianqing even went to Jiangzhou
in person.

23:01.585 --> 23:04.585
Who knows what he's plotting.

23:04.665 --> 23:06.065
At this rate,

23:06.145 --> 23:09.225
not only our Ling clan,
but Cangcang as well

23:10.705 --> 23:12.185
will find it

23:12.905 --> 23:17.225
even harder
to survive in that imperial city.

23:22.185 --> 23:23.785
Whatever you need of me,

23:24.305 --> 23:25.305
I will not refuse.

23:34.705 --> 23:36.265
Cangcang, go easy on the wine.

23:36.345 --> 23:37.865
This really isn't like you.

23:40.505 --> 23:42.825
Jueding said a jar of wine and a sword,

23:42.905 --> 23:43.905
that's the real me.

23:44.425 --> 23:45.865
Isn't that just the old Ling Cangcang?

23:45.945 --> 23:46.985
How is that not me?

23:53.745 --> 23:56.225
At this point,
you have to learn to move on.

23:58.865 --> 24:01.105
Yeah, move on.

24:01.185 --> 24:02.225
That's why I'm saying,

24:02.305 --> 24:04.505
why don't we go back
and rebuild Fenglai Pavilion?

24:08.505 --> 24:09.425
What's wrong?

24:09.945 --> 24:11.385
You're acting really strange.

24:12.665 --> 24:13.585
Are you hiding something from me?

24:23.945 --> 24:25.505
-Cangcang, I…
-I know.

24:29.265 --> 24:31.265
You've been bewitched by Xiao Qianqing.

24:34.065 --> 24:35.505
What are you even talking about?

24:36.705 --> 24:37.705
You're lying to me.

24:38.585 --> 24:39.465
No…

24:39.545 --> 24:42.345
We're talking about you.
How did this get turned on me?

24:43.065 --> 24:44.665
Look how flustered you are.

24:44.745 --> 24:46.065
I hit the mark, didn't I?

24:46.145 --> 24:48.345
-You do like him.
-Don't talk nonsense.

24:48.425 --> 24:51.225
So what if you like him?
What's so hard about admitting it?

24:57.865 --> 24:59.065
Cangcang,

25:00.385 --> 25:01.625
I actually…

26:05.305 --> 26:06.585
What are you doing here?

26:07.385 --> 26:09.665
So my brother can come, but I can't?

26:19.985 --> 26:22.305
Cangcang, why did you leave so suddenly?

26:26.545 --> 26:28.065
Come back to the Capital with me.

26:28.145 --> 26:29.505
You promised you would.

26:30.625 --> 26:32.745
It's harsh out here,
nothing like the palace.

26:32.825 --> 26:34.705
Why don't we head back a little earlier?

26:35.585 --> 26:36.665
We?

26:37.705 --> 26:38.865
You mean…

26:39.385 --> 26:40.865
you and I going back
to the Capital together?

26:43.545 --> 26:44.545
Xiao Huan,

26:46.945 --> 26:48.185
stop coming after me.

26:48.705 --> 26:51.305
You're the Empress of Great Qi,
head of Fenglai Pavilion.

26:51.385 --> 26:52.905
How can someone like you
go back on her word?

26:53.945 --> 26:55.425
Ten more li ahead,

26:55.505 --> 26:56.745
and we'll reach Yanxia Lake.

26:57.505 --> 26:59.065
We can take the waterway back.

27:07.585 --> 27:09.745
I just feel there are things

27:10.625 --> 27:11.785
I need to sort out in my head.

27:21.785 --> 27:23.065
He's chased his wife a thousand li,

27:23.145 --> 27:25.265
and you insist on getting in the way here.

27:26.545 --> 27:28.985
They get to enjoy the scenery
on their way back,

27:29.065 --> 27:31.345
while I have to deal
with all those old foxes.

27:31.945 --> 27:33.185
How is that fair?

27:33.265 --> 27:34.985
She's the Empress of Great Qi.

27:35.065 --> 27:36.665
How could that be the same?

27:37.545 --> 27:38.385
I'm warning you,

27:39.185 --> 27:40.465
with that attitude,

27:40.545 --> 27:43.265
watch they don't dump you halfway
and feed you to the wolves.

27:44.185 --> 27:45.865
I'm not scared.

27:45.945 --> 27:46.865
I've still got you, don't I?

27:47.545 --> 27:49.145
You won't have the heart to dump me.

27:49.225 --> 27:51.825
I'll toss you in first!

28:05.545 --> 28:07.425
Please don't hurt my child!

28:16.305 --> 28:17.225
Zhong Lin!

28:19.385 --> 28:20.985
Zhong Lin!

28:53.345 --> 28:54.185
Zhong Lin!

28:59.185 --> 29:00.025
What did you make her take?

29:06.505 --> 29:08.385
You think we're idiots

29:08.465 --> 29:09.545
who'd swallow your poison?

29:09.625 --> 29:10.705
Say one more word

29:11.225 --> 29:12.505
-and I'll stab her again!
-Wait!

29:12.585 --> 29:14.265
Stop!

29:23.865 --> 29:24.785
Eat it, now!

29:40.945 --> 29:42.345
I thought it was something serious.

29:42.425 --> 29:44.425
Turns out it's just
some cheap soft-bone powder.

29:45.225 --> 29:47.065
Hardly worth all this fuss.

29:47.665 --> 29:49.745
Talk! What do you people actually want?

29:49.825 --> 29:51.785
Send someone who can negotiate.

30:26.065 --> 30:28.305
ZHU SHA,
BRANCH LEADER OF THE LINGBI SECT

30:49.265 --> 30:50.945
Honestly,

30:51.465 --> 30:54.385
none of you know how to treat a lady.

30:54.985 --> 30:57.185
Such a pretty little thing,

30:57.265 --> 30:59.265
how can you be so rough with her?

30:59.345 --> 31:00.745
Who on earth are you?

31:01.265 --> 31:02.345
Don't hurt her.

31:02.425 --> 31:04.785
-If you want to talk, talk to me.
-Talk to you?

31:05.305 --> 31:06.865
Sure. Come here.

31:11.065 --> 31:12.105
Cangcang, don't come any closer…

31:12.185 --> 31:14.345
This is Bone-Eating Ice, deadly poison.

31:21.145 --> 31:22.145
So you're one of us.

31:23.025 --> 31:25.265
No wonder
you know what Bone-Eating Ice is.

31:25.785 --> 31:27.265
How funny.

31:27.345 --> 31:29.105
Since when did the Lingbi Sect's assassins

31:29.185 --> 31:32.185
grow so soft-hearted?

31:33.305 --> 31:34.625
What are you talking about?

31:34.705 --> 31:35.825
What Lingbi Sect assassin?

31:37.705 --> 31:39.145
Looks like your friend

31:39.225 --> 31:40.985
still doesn't know who you really are.

31:43.865 --> 31:45.625
We've got two grown men right here.

31:45.705 --> 31:47.065
Why are you bullying a girl?

31:47.145 --> 31:48.545
If you've got guts, come at us!

31:50.145 --> 31:51.465
Don't rush.

31:52.825 --> 31:54.265
Here I am.

31:56.985 --> 31:58.185
Heal her.

31:58.265 --> 31:59.865
Otherwise, there's nothing to talk about.

32:01.265 --> 32:02.145
Sir,

32:02.225 --> 32:04.785
how did you know I wanted to talk to you?

32:04.865 --> 32:06.705
If anything happens to her,

32:06.785 --> 32:07.625
I can guarantee

32:07.705 --> 32:10.505
that what you want will never be yours.

32:12.105 --> 32:13.785
Oh, I'm so scared!

32:15.585 --> 32:18.425
Treating her isn't out of the question.

32:22.385 --> 32:23.625
This sir,

32:23.705 --> 32:26.465
you were so fired up just now.

32:26.545 --> 32:28.905
What, trying to play the hero?

32:29.585 --> 32:30.465
And what if I am?

32:31.545 --> 32:32.865
How about this:

32:32.945 --> 32:36.065
if you stab yourself once,

32:36.145 --> 32:37.265
I'll treat her wound.

32:38.985 --> 32:39.985
Xiao Qianqing,

32:40.065 --> 32:41.465
don't listen to this madwoman…

32:41.545 --> 32:42.785
Well?

32:43.665 --> 32:44.705
If you don't,

32:44.785 --> 32:47.105
Miss Zhong will die
from this Bone-Eating Ice.

33:03.265 --> 33:04.185
Not deep enough.

33:04.785 --> 33:08.865
Go deeper and the two ladies
will go to the VIP parlor.

33:08.945 --> 33:11.065
There'll be food, drink,

33:11.145 --> 33:12.985
medicine, and a warm brazier.

33:30.945 --> 33:32.345
That's the spirit!

33:32.865 --> 33:36.785
Take Miss Ling and Miss Zhong
to the VIP parlor.

33:36.865 --> 33:37.705
Yes, Madam!

33:51.585 --> 33:53.865
The drug we gave you
does more than just sap your strength

33:53.945 --> 33:55.665
and block your inner force.

33:55.745 --> 33:57.585
It also slows your bleeding.

33:58.185 --> 34:00.265
You'll die very slowly,

34:00.345 --> 34:01.265
and ever so beautifully.

34:03.225 --> 34:04.305
What are you really after?

34:05.225 --> 34:06.465
I thought you knew.

34:06.545 --> 34:08.264
How would I know if you don't say?

34:08.784 --> 34:09.625
Don't rush.

34:10.344 --> 34:13.385
You can stay here
and slowly admire your brother's misery.

34:41.385 --> 34:42.465
Cangcang…

34:45.225 --> 34:46.824
there's something

34:48.465 --> 34:50.865
I've never known how to say to you.

34:53.304 --> 34:54.505
I…

35:05.865 --> 35:07.185
You don't have to.

35:08.105 --> 35:09.225
I already know.

35:09.865 --> 35:11.105
I've actually suspected for a long time

35:11.745 --> 35:13.785
that Master sent you to my side.

35:14.545 --> 35:16.625
After his identity was exposed,

35:16.705 --> 35:18.305
I started doubting who you were too.

35:19.705 --> 35:20.785
But…

35:23.225 --> 35:24.505
if the truth had really come out,

35:25.025 --> 35:27.025
I wouldn't have known
how to face it either.

35:29.945 --> 35:30.905
Cangcang,

35:31.425 --> 35:33.785
I never meant to hide it from you.

35:34.745 --> 35:37.265
You're the person I care about most.

35:38.065 --> 35:41.665
I'd rather go to my death
than ever hurt you in the slightest.

35:41.745 --> 35:42.945
I know.

35:43.465 --> 35:45.825
That's why I trust you.
I won't hold it against you.

35:52.585 --> 35:54.385
After everything we've been through,

35:54.465 --> 35:55.425
I've finally realized

35:55.505 --> 35:57.865
a lot of things
aren't simply black or white.

35:57.945 --> 36:00.425
I know you must have had your reasons.

36:04.225 --> 36:05.385
You've changed.

36:06.345 --> 36:08.425
It's like you suddenly grew up.

36:11.865 --> 36:12.985
Let's drop it.

36:13.065 --> 36:16.065
Our top priority now
is figuring out how to get out of here.

36:18.945 --> 36:21.025
Those people are from the Lingbi Sect?

36:21.105 --> 36:21.945
Right.

36:23.185 --> 36:24.785
They know who we are,

36:25.305 --> 36:26.625
and they know ordinary poisons

36:26.705 --> 36:28.385
can't do anything to Xiao Huan,

36:29.105 --> 36:31.265
so they hit us
with soft-bone powder right away.

36:31.345 --> 36:33.905
Looks like they came well-prepared.

36:39.025 --> 36:39.865
What is she after?

36:42.545 --> 36:43.505
How's your wound?

36:44.545 --> 36:46.705
I hate it
when you dodge the question like that.

36:46.785 --> 36:48.065
Same.

36:48.585 --> 36:50.545
I hate it when you keep badgering me.

36:52.065 --> 36:53.625
I only got hurt because of you.

36:53.705 --> 36:55.705
You clearly just wanted to play the hero.

36:55.785 --> 36:56.625
What's that got to do with me?

36:56.705 --> 36:58.425
Of course it has to do with you.

36:58.505 --> 36:59.705
They were obviously coming for you.

37:00.545 --> 37:03.385
If I'd known,
I should've wiped them all out.

37:06.105 --> 37:08.745
What else do you know
about the Lingbi Sect?

37:09.465 --> 37:12.185
Ever since Master Li Lu sent me to you,

37:12.785 --> 37:14.505
I've barely had any contact with them.

37:15.025 --> 37:16.705
I only heard
their saintess came out of seclusion.

37:17.425 --> 37:18.785
And not long ago,

37:18.865 --> 37:20.785
a Lingbi Sect Protector
suddenly came to me

37:22.785 --> 37:23.865
and ordered me to kill Xiao Qianqing.

37:24.945 --> 37:26.465
There was such a thing?

37:26.545 --> 37:29.105
And Xiao Qianqing
pulled a disappearing act

37:29.185 --> 37:30.865
and helped me get away.

37:30.945 --> 37:32.985
But now that they've recognized me again,

37:33.065 --> 37:34.505
they definitely won't let this go.

37:35.825 --> 37:37.665
But this time,
I won't dance to their tune.

37:38.265 --> 37:41.305
Their earlier attempt
to kill Xiao Qianqing

37:42.425 --> 37:43.705
is surely not as simple as it seems.

37:44.905 --> 37:47.705
And the woman today
doesn't seem to want him dead.

37:48.225 --> 37:49.745
Then what does she want?

37:51.825 --> 37:52.985
This operation

37:53.545 --> 37:54.945
is to intercept and kill
the Emperor of Great Qi

37:55.705 --> 37:57.385
and take back
the Lingbi Sect's sacred relic.

37:57.905 --> 37:59.505
That's the Emperor of Great Qi!

37:59.585 --> 38:01.225
And you dare set an ambush for him?

38:01.785 --> 38:02.625
Don't forget:

38:03.145 --> 38:05.425
if he doesn't die, you will.

38:27.105 --> 38:28.705
I forgot to introduce myself.

38:29.465 --> 38:31.865
I'm Zhu Sha,
branch leader of Shuyang chapter

38:31.945 --> 38:32.985
of the Lingbi Sect.

38:33.985 --> 38:35.025
As for me,

38:35.105 --> 38:38.865
I love thinking up
new ways to torment people.

38:39.385 --> 38:41.985
So should I try them out on you,

38:42.065 --> 38:44.225
or on Ling Cangcang?

38:44.905 --> 38:46.065
If you lay a finger on her,

38:46.585 --> 38:47.425
I swear

38:47.505 --> 38:50.185
you'll never get what you're after!

38:50.265 --> 38:54.185
They say emperors are heartless.

38:54.265 --> 38:57.345
But you'd turn out
to be such a lovesick fool!

38:57.425 --> 39:00.585
I heard the Ghost King's token,
the Moon-Eclipse, is in your hands.

39:00.665 --> 39:02.905
How about this: divorce Ling Cangcang,

39:02.985 --> 39:03.825
and I'll marry you.

39:04.545 --> 39:06.545
You be the Emperor,
I'll be the Ghost King.

39:06.625 --> 39:08.865
We'll work together and rule the world.

39:10.465 --> 39:15.025
My brother doesn't need to work
with some freakish witch like you.

39:16.065 --> 39:17.145
Xiao Qianqing,

39:17.225 --> 39:19.185
do you want Zhong Lin dead that badly?

39:19.265 --> 39:21.345
Guards! Go tie Zhong Lin up!

39:21.425 --> 39:22.585
Wait!

39:23.105 --> 39:23.945
Miss…

39:24.025 --> 39:26.345
Miss Zhu Sha, hold on.

39:26.425 --> 39:27.385
Don't be hasty.

39:27.465 --> 39:30.065
If he won't agree, you can have me.

39:30.705 --> 39:34.105
I… I am younger than he is,
and a lot gentler.

39:34.825 --> 39:36.865
We can work together.

39:40.105 --> 39:40.945
Really?

39:44.105 --> 39:45.985
Guards, open the cage.

39:52.625 --> 39:56.145
But I like
the proud streak on you even more.

39:57.505 --> 39:58.985
If you're willing
to spend one night with me,

39:59.065 --> 40:00.945
I'll let them go.

40:01.025 --> 40:03.745
-How about it?
-What's wrong with your taste?

40:03.825 --> 40:05.825
He's got no sense of romance at all.

40:06.345 --> 40:07.745
I'm different.

40:07.825 --> 40:08.705
Guards,

40:09.905 --> 40:12.345
-take him to my room.
-Yes, Madam!

40:36.825 --> 40:38.905
You really are a stunning beauty.

40:39.425 --> 40:42.785
No wonder the Emperor
fell so hard for you.

40:42.865 --> 40:44.145
Cut the nonsense.

40:44.665 --> 40:45.705
What exactly are you after?

40:46.225 --> 40:49.465
There are so many lovesick ones
in this world.

40:50.065 --> 40:51.105
Whether their love is real,

40:51.785 --> 40:54.665
my Illusion-Butterfly Powder will tell.

40:56.945 --> 40:57.785
Tell me,

40:58.785 --> 41:00.625
for your sake,

41:01.425 --> 41:03.745
will Xiao Huan hand over the Moon-Eclipse?

41:56.465 --> 41:58.345
Cangcang, does it still hurt?

42:02.665 --> 42:04.825
Let's think of a way to get out of here.

42:06.345 --> 42:07.425
Your Majesty…

42:11.345 --> 42:13.265
Cangcang, what's wrong?

42:19.265 --> 42:20.105
Cangcang!

42:21.345 --> 42:22.865
It's me, Xiao Huan!

42:23.745 --> 42:25.545
She's inhaled
my Illusion-Butterfly Powder.

42:26.225 --> 42:28.505
It traps people in illusions.

42:29.225 --> 42:32.705
Her mind and the drug will tear at her,
driving her into agony

42:33.225 --> 42:35.905
until her insides collapse and she dies.

42:38.745 --> 42:41.985
How long do you think she can last?

42:43.465 --> 42:45.465
Zhu Sha, how can you be so vicious?

42:45.545 --> 42:47.345
You're only realizing that now?

42:47.425 --> 42:50.145
You just want the Moon-Eclipse, don't you?
I can give it to you!

42:50.745 --> 42:51.585
Right now, in her eyes,

42:51.665 --> 42:54.545
you're a mortal enemy
she's fighting to the death.

42:55.145 --> 42:58.185
Cangcang, it's me, Xiao Huan.

42:58.785 --> 43:00.145
I don't believe you'd really kill me.
